<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>I Told You So — Hannes Nagel</title>
    <meta name="description" content="I Told You So is a tiny iOS app for recording predictions and friendly bets, settling them later, and sharing a clean receipt.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
    <style>
        :root {
            --itys: #bf5b34;
        }

        .itys-hero .sub-header,
        .itys-hero h1 em {
            color: var(--itys);
        }

        .itys-hero .sub-header::before {
            background: var(--itys);
        }

        /* ---- the receipt ---- */

        .receipt-wrap {
            width: 100%;
            display: grid;
            justify-items: center;
            margin-top: 1.2rem;
        }

        .receipt {
            width: min(420px, 100%);
            background: #fffdf6;
            border: 1px solid var(--line);
            border-radius: 6px;
            padding: 1.4rem 1.5rem 1.7rem;
            font-family: "Courier New", ui-monospace, monospace;
            color: #2b2b25;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
            position: relative;
            transform: rotate(-1.2deg);
            transition: transform 0.3s var(--spring);
        }

        .receipt:hover {
            transform: rotate(0.4deg) scale(1.015);
        }

        .receipt::before,
        .receipt::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 8px;
            background-image: linear-gradient(45deg, transparent 33.333%, #fffdf6 33.333%, #fffdf6 66.667%, transparent 66.667%),
                linear-gradient(-45deg, transparent 33.333%, #fffdf6 33.333%, #fffdf6 66.667%, transparent 66.667%);
            background-size: 14px 16px;
        }

        .receipt::before {
            top: -8px;
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }

        .receipt::after {
            bottom: -8px;
        }

        .receipt h3 {
            font-family: inherit;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.04em;
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .receipt .r-sub {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.72rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8b887c;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .receipt dl {
            margin: 0;
            display: grid;
            gap: 0.55rem;
            border-top: 1px dashed #b9b4a2;
            border-bottom: 1px dashed #b9b4a2;
            padding: 0.9rem 0;
        }

        .receipt dt {
            font-size: 0.68rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.16em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            color: #8b887c;
        }

        .receipt dd {
            margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
            font-size: 0.98rem;
        }

        .receipt .r-foot {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.7rem;
            color: #8b887c;
            margin-top: 0.9rem;
            letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        }

        .stamp {
            position: absolute;
            top: 38%;
            right: 6%;
            border: 3px solid var(--itys);
            color: var(--itys);
            font: 800 1.3rem var(--sans);
            letter-spacing: 0.18em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transform: rotate(-14deg) scale(3);
            opacity: 0;
            pointer-events: none;
            mix-blend-mode: multiply;
        }

        .stamp.slam {
            animation: stamp-slam 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1.3, 0.5, 1) forwards;
        }

        @keyframes stamp-slam {
            0% { transform: rotate(-14deg) scale(3); opacity: 0; }
            60% { transform: rotate(-14deg) scale(0.92); opacity: 1; }
            80% { transform: rotate(-13deg) scale(1.06); opacity: 1; }
            100% { transform: rotate(-14deg) scale(1); opacity: 1; }
        }

        .settle-btn {
            margin-top: 1.1rem;
            border: 1px solid var(--itys);
            background: var(--itys);
            color: #fff;
            font: 700 0.95rem var(--sans);
            border-radius: 999px;
            padding: 0.65rem 1.3rem;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: transform 0.25s var(--spring), background-color 0.2s ease;
        }

        .settle-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px) rotate(-1deg);
        }

        .settle-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.93);
        }

        .settle-btn[disabled] {
            background: #9c9685;
            border-color: #9c9685;
            cursor: default;
            transform: none;
        }

        .itys-cards .card-cta {
            color: var(--itys);
        }

        .f-icon {
            width: 38px;
            height: 38px;
            border-radius: 11px;
            display: grid;
            place-items: center;
            background: rgba(191, 91, 52, 0.1);
            color: var(--itys);
            margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
        }

        .f-icon svg {
            width: 21px;
            height: 21px;
        }

        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            .stamp.slam {
                animation: none;
                opacity: 1;
                transform: rotate(-14deg) scale(1);
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div id="site-nav"></div>

    <main class="page">
        <section class="hero itys-hero">
            <p class="sub-header">iOS App</p>
            <h1>Receipts for <em>bold claims</em>.</h1>
            <p class="lead">Capture predictions, friendly bets, and confident statements before everyone changes their story. Settle the outcome later and keep the receipt.</p>
            <div class="cta-buttons">
                <a class="nav-link" href="https://apps.apple.com/app/id6763559466">Get it on the App Store</a>
                <a class="nav-link" href="/i-told-you-so/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
                <a class="nav-link" href="/contact">Support</a>
            </div>

            <div class="receipt-wrap">
                <div class="receipt" aria-label="Example receipt">
                    <h3>I told you so.</h3>
                    <p class="r-sub">Bet receipt</p>
                    <dl>
                        <dt>Claim</dt>
                        <dd>“This app idea is too silly to ship.”</dd>
                        <dt>Who said it</dt>
                        <dd>A friend, very confidently</dd>
                        <dt>Stake</dt>
                        <dd>One pizza</dd>
                        <dt>Result</dt>
                        <dd id="receipt-result">Pending…</dd>
                    </dl>
                    <p class="r-foot">SAVE THE CLAIM · SETTLE THE OUTCOME · SHARE IT</p>
                    <span class="stamp" id="stamp">Settled</span>
                </div>
                <button class="settle-btn" id="settle" type="button">Settle the bet</button>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="work itys-cards">
            <div class="section-head">
                <p class="sub-header" style="color: var(--itys);">What it does</p>
                <h2>For the moments people conveniently forget.</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="cards">
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 20l1.2-4.2L16.4 4.6a2.05 2.05 0 0 1 2.9 2.9L8.2 18.8 4 20z"/><path d="M13.8 7.2l2.9 2.9"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Record it fast</h3>
                        <p>Write down who said what, what they predicted, and what is at stake — in seconds, mid-conversation.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8.5"/><path d="M8.2 12.4l2.6 2.6 5-5.4"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Settle it later</h3>
                        <p>Come back when reality catches up and mark who was right. The app keeps the original wording.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
                <article class="card">
                    <div class="card-body">
                        <span class="f-icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M6.5 3h11v18l-1.85-1.4L13.8 21l-1.8-1.4L10.2 21l-1.85-1.4L6.5 21V3z"/><path d="M9.5 8h5M9.5 11.5h5M9.5 15h3"/></svg></span>
                        <h3>Share the receipt</h3>
                        <p>Create a clean proof card for the group chat. Petty? Maybe. Satisfying? Absolutely.</p>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="footer-cta">
            <p class="sub-header">Say hello</p>
            <h2>Questions or support?</h2>
            <div class="links">
                <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
                <a href="/i-told-you-so/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
            </div>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script src="/js/components.js"></script>
    <script>
        (function () {
            var btn = document.getElementById('settle');
            var stamp = document.getElementById('stamp');
            var result = document.getElementById('receipt-result');
            if (!btn || !stamp) { return; }
            btn.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
                stamp.classList.add('slam');
                result.textContent = 'Very wrong. Pizza owed.';
                btn.textContent = 'Settled ✓';
                btn.disabled = true;
                if (window.hnConfetti) {
                    window.hnConfetti(e.clientX, e.clientY, 60);
                }
            });
        })();
    </script>
</body>

</html>
